    "text": {
     "en": "The three Rs are Reduce, Reuse and Recycle.\nReduce means use less. Carry a cloth bag instead of plastic bags.\nReuse means use again. Use old jars for storing things and write on both sides of paper.\nRecycle means turn old things into new ones, like old paper into new paper.\nSay no to single-use plastic."
    }
